DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuddaavv driver provides support for USB Ethernet adapters based on the
     Davicom DM9601 USB-ether bridge chip.

     The uuddaavv driver supports the following adapters:

           Corega FEther USB-TXC
           HenTong WK-668
           Konig CMP-NWUSB10
           ShanTou ST268
           ShanTou ZT6688
           ShanTou ADM8515

     The uuddaavv driver also supports CoreChip RD9700.  As many of these units
     ship with the same MAC address, it is highly recommended to use
     ifconfig(8) llllaaddddrr to set the address manually, or llllaaddddrr rraannddoomm to as‐
     sign a random address.

     For more information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

